  "what": "bound_cause.c on the tree after's unit, clang 18, clang 23 and gcc: five forms of the table's rotation whose inner loops differ only in their bound's expression -- first (a6f8feb1's: the range's count), fix (ROPE-BOUND's: the head's half where it fits one range), proto (ROPE-TABLE-0's: the head's half, no ranges), half_k (the ranges, bound half-k0), min64 (no ranges, bound min(half, 64)) -- every value the first's byte for byte, each the median of 9 rounds of the mean of 100 calls",
